# Serah Farron (CR 601.2f, 118.7, 603.4, 701.27, 613.4c): on turn 1 Bot1 casts her. On turn 3 the first legendary creature spell Bot1
# casts costs {2} less - a nonlegendary Ornithopter cast before it does not use the discount up - so Arnyn Deathbloom Botanist
# ({2}{B}) is paid with the one Mox Jet; Isamaru ({W}) has no generic mana to lose. At the beginning of combat Bot1 controls two
# other legendary creatures, and transforms Serah: Crystallized Serah is no creature, and legendary creatures Bot1 controls get
# +2/+2 (Isamaru 4/4, Arnyn 4/4; Bot1's Ornithopter 0/2 stays).

